<title>EGYPT: Egypt overnight pound rates fall, one-week steady.</title>
<headline>Egypt overnight pound rates fall, one-week steady.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound fell in the private sector market on Tuesday to between 10 1/8 and 10 1/4 percent from Monday's range of 10 1/4 and 10 1/2 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates were steady between 10 1/8 and 10 1/4 percent.</p>
<p>State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
